    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      230.54,
      546.89,
      257.06
    ],
    "text": "The very severe cyclonic storm \u201cArnab,\u201d which was located over the west-central Bay of Bengal has crossed the coast of Andhra Pradesh, India.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      273.89,
      546.82,
      358.97
    ],
    "text": "Wind speeds in the sea areas bounded by 12N to 20N latitude and 80E to 87E longitude may increase to 80-100 kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, the wave height may increase about (3.0 \u2013 4.0) meters in the mentioned sea areas and the sea conditions in these areas will become very rough. Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the above mentioned sea areas until further notice. Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move away from the affected sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      375.77,
      546.22,
      404.69
    ],
    "text": "The naval and fishing communities, are requested to be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the Department of Meteorology in this regard.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      419.69,
      151.29,
      431.69
    ],
    "text": "Condition of Rain:",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      58.92,
      438.73,
      513.41,
      452.69
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places in the sea areas around the island.",
